t,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">英伟达CEO黄仁勋与特朗普通话，明确反对放慢AI发展并支持扩大基础设施建设</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">GPT-6 Astra在Vending-Bench2模拟测试中以1.5万美元收益登顶</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">05</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">Anthropic在Claude Code灰度测试Opus 5.2并启用内部Model 2模型</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">蚂蚁集团开源大模型内生安全护栏技术SingProbe，实现实时风险拦截</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/1b9f194842df46170517952e8d202bcd.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">蚂蚁集团AI安全实验室正式开源大模型内生式安全护栏技术SingProbe。该方案区别于传统外挂式审核，通过复用基座模型推理过程中的隐藏状态，以不足0.5%的额外计算开销，实现token级实时风险评估。SingProbe支持同步完成意图分类、安全检测及幻觉识别任务，可在内容输出前实施毫秒级阻断，在高风险场景下具备显著优势。目前，该技术已适配29个主流大模型，是首个由大型科技企业开源的完整内生式安全技术解决方案。相关开源代码及预训练模型已同步发布，为行业提供了一种低开销、高效率的大模型安全防御新范式。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">苹果iOS 27代码揭示Siri支持接入Claude与GPT-5.6及模型替换机制</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/a32dfb79f40f3ed73e377d63b42b5bce.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">开发者在iOS 27与macOS Golden Gate底层代码中发现，苹果已构建支持第三方模型深度协作的AI架构，包含“模型委托”与“推理提供方”两套机制。模型委托允许Claude等第三方模型以Siri扩展形式运行，负责解析自然语言并调用Siri执行系统级任务，或补足Siri的能力盲区。更深层的推理提供方机制则允许用户将端侧Siri模型替换为GPT-5.6等外部模型，由第三方模型接管Siri规划器与工具定义，自主请求系统操作并处理个人数据。受欧盟《数字市场法》推动，苹果正通过此类工程设计实现模型互操作性。目前相关功能尚未向用户开放，仅在代码层面验证了Claude与GPT-5.6的接入可行性，苹果尚未正式授权第三方模型委托权限。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">英伟达CEO黄仁勋与特朗普通话，明确反对放慢AI发展并支持扩大基础设施建设</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/b46444e2e953c80deb423516af8cad2d.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">英伟达CEO黄仁勋在洛杉矶All-In Summit峰会上与美国总统特朗普通话，明确反对近期部分科技领袖提出的“放慢”AI发展速度的呼吁。针对Anthropic CEO达里奥·阿莫迪、埃隆·马斯克及萨姆·奥特曼等人的观点，黄仁勋认为放慢AI发展可能迎合了阻碍产业进步的力量。特朗普在通话中强调，美国不会因政治或外部竞争因素放缓AI发展，将继续扩大AI基础设施建设，以保持在AI领域的全球领先地位。针对当前美国社会对数据中心扩张的反对情绪，特别是盖洛普调查显示约七成民众担忧环境资源及生活质量影响，特朗普表示政府将在谨慎推进的同时，确保不会“扼杀”AI行业。此次对话明确了英伟达与美国政府在AI基础设施扩张上的战略共识，对后续数据中心建设及AI算力布局具有重要行业导向意义。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">GPT-6 Astra在Vending-Bench2模拟测试中以1.5万美元收益登顶</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/97e0da57e2103d5ec8cf42c69e3ccbf6.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">Andon Labs开展的Vending-Bench2测试显示，GPT-6 Astra在为期一年的自动售货机商业模拟中表现卓越，平均最终账户余额达15515美元，成绩约为Claude Fable 5.1的三倍。测试中，GPT-6 Astra展现出极强的长期低价采购能力，成功将商品报价压低至原价的48%，且在运行周期内规则执行高度稳定，未产生预付款损失。相比之下，Claude Fable 5.1因采购成本上涨及规则执行偏差导致亏损。此外，GPT-6 Astra在复杂的三人竞技测试中表现稳健，拒绝违规协作并赢下全部三轮比赛。该测试结果表明，长期自主性与规则执行的稳定性已成为衡量AI Agent核心竞争力的关键指标，标志着AI代理在复杂商业场景下的决策与执行能力迈向新阶段。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Anthropic在Claude Code灰度测试Opus 5.2并启用内部Model 2模型</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/0bc19e8d5c77782b01d62f0e2d95bcf9.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">Anthropic近日在Claude Code中悄然开启旗舰模型Opus 5.2的灰度测试。开发者通过抓包确认，后端模型slug已指向Opus 5.2，其在实际工作流中的表现与网页版Opus 5存在显著差异。与此同时，一份内部风险报告披露，Anthropic正在部署一款代号为Model 2的“核武级”模型。该模型已接管公司大部分代码编写任务，据称将替代85%的研究团队人力。这一动向表明，Anthropic不仅在加速模型迭代节奏，更在深度重构研发组织形态，通过AI替代内部研发人员以提升效率。Opus 5.2的灰度测试与Model 2的内部应用，共同揭示了Anthropic在代码生成与自动化研发领域的技术布局已进入深水区，其模型对复杂工程任务的接管深度远超外界预期。</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
